    <!-- About Dialog -->
    <string name="about_dialog_title">About This App</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_content">App Name: MutualTransfer – बिहार शिक्षक आपसी तबादला\nVersion: 1.0.0\nDeveloper: Sohrab Tech Solutions\nEmail: iamsohrabalam@gmail.com\n\n📢 Disclaimer:\nThis application is not affiliated with the Government of Bihar or any official education department. It is an independent platform created to help Bihar government school teachers connect with each other for mutual transfers more easily.\n\nAll information is user-submitted, and while we aim to maintain accuracy, we do not guarantee or take responsibility for the correctness of transfer-related data.\n\nAlways confirm with official channels or your district education office before proceeding with any transfer.\n\n📄 Privacy &amp; Data Policy:\nWe collect only necessary information (e.g., name, school, district) to facilitate mutual matching.\nYour data is not shared with any third party and remains secure on Firebase.</string>

